"""Type stub for the compiled extension.

Generated by `tools/gen_stub.py` from the result dataclasses and the specs. Do
not edit by hand: the result classes below are what `azoth.core.result` says, the
signatures are what the specs declare, and both are already asserted equal to the
Rust side by tests.

Nothing here is part of the public API. `azoth.hydraulics` is, and it returns the
result dataclasses in `azoth.core.result` rather than the transport types below -
see `azoth._rust_bridge`.
"""

